{"path":"/zh/concepts/typed-ir-chain/","title":"类型化中间表示链：逐步收敛自然语言结构","blocks":[{"block_id":"adps-8386dffcb576f5c1-1","revision":"8386dffcb576f5c1aeaabbdb5c823952bf5edf44ab645715333f0b4595761fad","tag":"p","quote":"用户要求在“闸机控制”包下建立一张用例图。一次调用同时生成对象、关系和画布时，关系可能引用不存在的名称，视图也可能漏掉已经创建的元素。失败后只能整份重做。"},{"block_id":"adps-6261ad0526ad3dd0-1","revision":"6261ad0526ad3dd02baa376178a34633f00f1636c8c5c13c497c313bdad98bf7","tag":"p","quote":"类型化中间表示链把自然语言意图逐步收敛为可验证的数据结构。AI4MBSE 建模 Agent 项目可以还原为："},{"block_id":"adps-5c995898521479f9-1","revision":"5c995898521479f9c7c8f8ae869f34464d743939248d016c906339d5f87b11a0","tag":"pre","quote":"ModelingJob -> ElementPlan -> RelationPlan -> ViewPlan -> WriteSet"},{"block_id":"adps-c2eadd37f4c1b05e-1","revision":"c2eadd37f4c1b05e9b42422cd7295ec6508370c4cdf899ae362c7951a6c9fa79","tag":"p","quote":"每一段读取已验收的上游结果，输出带类型、稳定引用和来源的候选结构。验证器检查良构性，写入器只消费通过门禁的 WriteSet，不再重新理解自然语言。"},{"block_id":"adps-e24f2912db1fdc7c-1","revision":"e24f2912db1fdc7c2d7055dde7adeade47d64a1694a8f6c4d89587a1ac7427cf","tag":"p","quote":"序列化成 JSON 并不自动形成类型化 IR。字段类型、允许值、引用规则和阶段不变量必须由 schema 或验证器执行。阶段可以由多个 Agent、一个 Agent 的多次调用或普通函数完成，进程数量不影响概念成立。"},{"block_id":"adps-28a4a926a3956efc-1","revision":"28a4a926a3956efc48663b044acacbdf339475bdd0a2765dddbba2fc1fa85cc8","tag":"li","quote":"初始研究来源：AI4MBSE 建模 Agent 项目，作者袁良锭（Liangding Yuan）；契约名称由 ADPS 依据公开机制还原。"},{"block_id":"adps-7320c69e6325a2f2-1","revision":"7320c69e6325a2f213441b47947be0bc9858ee89e47f0e4b6903cde457e62a64","tag":"li","quote":"历史近邻：compiler IR、typed AST、semantic analysis、database referential integrity。"},{"block_id":"adps-996f0f1630c5b2e9-1","revision":"996f0f1630c5b2e993cea3ce597a85ee96ffe63e411b6c36a8c4c193aa608acd","tag":"li","quote":"ADPS 整理：模型起草候选 IR，程序验收阶段合同，写入器消费已验证结果。"},{"block_id":"adps-743b4de8c8fad102-1","revision":"743b4de8c8fad1025fec60b82cbc3451ba186867670e02df78b604cf3bd9eb89","tag":"li","quote":"定义地位：ADPS 重述。"},{"block_id":"adps-57bdf3334b75f2ef-1","revision":"57bdf3334b75f2ef23888a7d5d0622304cccd438037a66a30998c1d3f2297788","tag":"p","quote":"初始来源：AI4MBSE 建模 Agent 项目；作者：袁良锭（Liangding Yuan）。"},{"block_id":"adps-07336cb1f093d306-1","revision":"07336cb1f093d306f9f6694518f0138fa9925bd53440f26b6e21d427504c348d","tag":"p","quote":"案例报告目录 · 模式目录 · CC BY 4.0"},{"block_id":"adps-3c551855df185a69-1","revision":"3c551855df185a69bba5e6c436054cab73b1e5df7050f512e066b3f937c0e637","tag":"p","quote":"在 ADPS Chronicle 中查看"}]}
